WEBVTT

00:05.800 --> 00:07.200
Enough

00:07.480 --> 00:08.880
Enough

00:09.480 --> 00:11.320
I will request to be demoted to commoner

00:11.400 --> 00:12.680
Only this way

00:12.760 --> 00:14.760
Can elder brother be at ease

00:16.360 --> 00:18.600
We'll hide our identities from now on

00:18.680 --> 00:21.347
And live as ordinary people in the mountains

